\p{
    As of November 2025 I joined the Ethereum Foundation, working on [Protocol
    Snarkification](dhsorens-0020). This mostly consists of formally specifying and verifying [ZK
    primitives](dhsorens-002C) in [Lean](dhsorens-lean).
